<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-21T02:42:19.983Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 02:42:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant forces continued to clash with security troops in Manipur, resulting in a militant killed and a suspected KCP-PWG cadre killed, with eight suspects apprehended. In Kashmir, Bhupender Singh assumed the role of IG of the BSF, while the lieutenant governor directed forces to dismantle the terror-separatist ecosystem and Amit Shah called for the elimination of terror, organised crime and drugs. Army commanders reviewed operational preparedness of troops in Poonch and along the LoC, and a civilian driver was killed when his vehicle skidded off the road in Bandipora. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQMWNxc3lYX2owQU1UX2JEOGhtQzhRV2k2aVJ1Z2NwUTVnbEl5QlYtZ3M1TlJBR0pwVGNpWWYyZ2QwWldRWFhyUW5MRngydkJpV2VrV1pIa3dLNm55dW9EWWM4al9Ca3BDRFQyYWZTNXFMNFQxUE9udV8tMHhIY0tOQnh3Z1B5SkpCM19FWTlMcks?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQX1NUSExPamVzSndXT1dvSXJlem1iM3hsbXRRRGdXdzBaSVN0cnBMa2dFN3ZHdGZLeDVwSVFvcDdQYTdiMmpCSU5jczRPcXJvcHUxRC1XZk44bUNPWlNhVDVrelJzbFR6SzY5eThnaW13elJxRzl3Vld2VE93bjJLZlNmcy10anAwTHgxZQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNTWlRcUxwNHlVcTlNT1M3eV9XQ3dnR25JNTFMRlFGeWhYeU16eEVaS2p3MGkyQUV3cnoxSG5mRjNlc0N0YUw4aEYwMEpsNjRuYURSTlAwS3RhYVhQbThEaXVXcWxaaUVWZzR0aTFDMFdvN3RaRlJrZG9IeTd3TW95TWxaMk5xY2VGeVJuQkJZNm5icU14TXhmaQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNODU2QndzTi1DdVBTZDJ1MjdJTEthamVtRE1rMHpHeVo0eGp5S0Q3WkE1SW5ESEk1cDdTLXRLdjRNM3pOR0NWWDJXeXBaV1JITjNGSHJwWGV3aG51TmpIY2N3SEV2YmJmRVdMWnBJSmVHNk8yT2Nxelp